OL,3,ANiamh O'Brien, dancer and wife of
OL,4,AMichael Flatley, dies at 52
OL,5,
OL,6,FNiamh O'Brien, a former lead performer
OL,7,Fin Lord of the Dance and the wife of
OL,8,FRiverdance star Michael Flatley, has
OL,9,Fdied at the age of 52.
OL,11,FAnnouncing her death on social media on
OL,12,FMonday, Flatley said his "heart is
OL,13,Fbroken".
OL,15,F"My gorgeous bride of twenty years has
OL,16,Fgone to the Lord in Heaven."
OL,18,FO'Brien was a renowned Irish dancer who
OL,19,Fperformed the lead role of Saoirse in
OL,20,Fthe Lord of the Dance shows.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
